list.item:
We have a plan for a military evacuation of American civilians from
                        Jordan, and would prefer to use a US brigade from Europe, rather than forces
                        from the US;

This military evacuation plan is essentially the same as that required to
                        secure the airfield where the hijacked planes have landed, if it should be
                        decided to attempt this move;

Mr. Saunders will prepare a status report on the hijacking situation and
                        on Rochat’s efforts to negotiate an extension of the deadline and extricate
                        the passengers;

The JCS will investigate ways in which we might put the US brigade in
                        Germany on semi-alert for a military evacuation operation with the minimum
                        possibility of its leaking;
